00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:27.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
L'histoire change de direction.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:29.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Hier soir lesarartisans du

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:31.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
président sortant se lamentaient

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:32.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la défaite en priant pour

00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:35.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un miracle

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:37.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(acclamations)

00:01:33.034 --> 00:01:41.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Contraste avec ces partisans

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:43.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Lula du quartier branch

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:45.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
