00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:47.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Lula! Lula! Lula!

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:49.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- ...qui se réjouissaient sans

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:51.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
